OSB is a modified version of nixxane/opensro-bot-lean
(https://github.com/nixxane/opensro-bot-lean), which was adapted from TSK's OpenSRO Assistant.

Base: nixxane/opensro-bot-lean commit bbd953d7c8a52cb12a98a2514aaee43de2b6d2a2 (version 1.2.231),
taken on 2026-11-09. OSB 2.0.0 started from version 1.2.212 and has since taken upstream's changes up to this commit.
The record of the last upstream commit OSB took is UPSTREAM.json.

